<h1 class="banner-title">

Symbiosis & Resilience Lab

</h1>

::: tagline
Understanding how ecological interactions fuel resilience in a changing ocean
:::
::::
:::::

::: photo-strip
![](Images/IMG-20260512-WA0130.jpg){.strip-photo alt="Coral reef panorama"}
![](Images/Acropora-parrot.JPG){.strip-photo alt="Parrotfish on Acropora coral"}
![](Images/STRI-lab-meeting.jpg){.strip-photo alt="Lab team in the field"}
